  "answer": "Beacon Insurance is a credible expansion example because its strong adoption and measurable outcomes demonstrate product value, and it already executed two recorded Q2 expansion events that validate its willingness to scale.\n\n**Adoption evidence:** In Q2 2026, KnowledgeHub adoption was 96.0% and TutorChat was 92.2%, both exceeding the 90% and 85% target benchmarks respectively [NL-025#NL-025-S03]. Claims adjusters integrated TutorChat into daily workflows, with weekly queries rising from 4,200 in Q1 to 6,800 in Q2 [NL-025#NL-025-S03].\n\n**Outcome evidence:** The platform reduced new claims adjuster onboarding from 6.2 weeks to 4.0 weeks, and internal support escalations fell by 22% [NL-025#NL-025-S04]. Citation trust improved to 94% after the April 15 validation update, giving the legal team confidence in policy accuracy [NL-025#NL-025-S04].\n\n**Recorded Q2 expansion events:** On 2026-05-15, Beacon Insurance (Enterprise plan) contributed $4,500 MRR expansion from \"Multi-department expansion (HR & Legal)\" and on 2026-06-25 added $1,500 MRR for \"Additional workspace index partition\" [NL-012#NL-012-S05]. These events show the account actively expanding within the same quarter while maintaining high engagement and operational gains, making it a strong, data-backed case for further expansion.\n\nANSWER_STATUS: answer\nUSED_MEMORY_CLAIMS: none",
